#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:8
msgid "低功耗运行时"
msgstr "Low-Power Runtime"

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:10
msgid "应用显式驱动协议工作。协议不内置时钟 provider、定时器线程或 sleep 实现。"
msgstr ""
"The application drives protocol work explicitly. There is no internal clock provider, timer thread, or "
"sleep implementation."

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:12
msgid "相对超时 API"
msgstr "Relative Timeout API"

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:14
msgid ""
"`xgl_step(handle, now_ms, &budget)` 轮询到期链路并推进 transport。`budget.rx_bytes` 是每条链路的字节上限；为零时跳过 RX 轮询，但仍维护 "
"parser 超时和 transport。`receive_timeout_ms` 控制不完整帧的 parser 超时，不是 API 阻塞等待时间。零表示关闭 parser 超时；最近一次有效 step "
"的超时策略应用于所有半帧，仍从原始起始时间计算，修改策略不会重新计时。"
msgstr ""
"`xgl_step(handle, now_ms, &budget)` polls each due link and advances transport work. `budget.rx_bytes` "
"is a per-link byte limit; zero skips RX polling while still maintaining parser expiry and transport. "
"`receive_timeout_ms` controls incomplete-frame parser timeout, not an API blocking wait. Zero disables "
"parser expiry. The latest valid step's timeout applies to all incomplete frames from their original "
"start timestamps; changing it does not restart parsing."

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:16
msgid ""
"Parser 截止时间独立于 PHY 轮询间隔参与 `xgl_deadline_query()`。即使 PHY 每秒才轮询一次，10 ms 的半帧仍会在 10 ms 到期。到期后只重置和报告一次，零 RX "
"字节预算也会维护超时。"
msgstr ""
"`xgl_deadline_query()` includes the parser deadline independently of the PHY poll interval. An "
"incomplete frame with a 10 ms timeout still expires in 10 ms when the PHY is polled once per second. The"
" parser resets and reports it once at expiry. A zero RX byte budget still allows timeout maintenance."

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:18
msgid ""
"Step 返回最先出现的 parser 超时、PHY、交付或 transport 错误，同时继续消费已读出的整个字节批次并维护 "
"transport。流中的格式错误帧被丢弃并通过诊断报告，不阻断后续帧的解析。PHY 成功读出字节不等于应用成功接纳。"
msgstr ""
"A step returns its first parser timeout, PHY, delivery or transport error while continuing to consume "
"the received byte chunk and maintain transport. Malformed stream frames are discarded and reported "
"through diagnostics; they do not stop parsing later frames. A successful PHY read alone does not imply "
"successful application admission."

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:20
msgid ""
"ACK/SACK 接收负责校验反馈并记录可执行工作。DATA 重传在 RX 处理后的 transport 维护阶段执行，可能仍在同一次 step 内完成。就绪的重传可以给出零超时；临时 PHY "
"或资源背压安排正的重试延迟。维护返回首个硬错误并继续其他 scope；重试已保留工作时的 BUSY 或 NO_MEMORY 属于正常背压，不会单独使 step 失败。即时 RX 接纳和 ACK "
"提交错误仍向上传递，ACK 失败不撤销已接纳字节或接收历史。"
msgstr ""
"ACK/SACK reception validates feedback and records ready work. DATA retries run in transport maintenance "
"after RX processing, possibly in that same step. Ready retransmissions can yield a zero timeout, and "
"temporary PHY or resource backpressure schedules a positive retry delay. Maintenance returns its first "
"hard error and continues other scopes. BUSY or NO_MEMORY while retrying retained work is normal "
"backpressure and does not alone fail the step. Immediate RX admission and ACK-submission errors still "
"propagate; an ACK failure does not revoke accepted bytes or receive history."

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:22
msgid ""
"每条到期链路在一次 step 中只读取 PHY 一次，读取量还受构建时 `XGL_DATALINK_RX_CHUNK_SIZE` 限制。`AUTO` 在 Boot 为 32 字节，其余 profile 为 "
"128 字节；运行期预算不是要求把该预算全部读满。选择较小 chunk 时，应重新核对整帧所需的轮询次数、驱动缓冲容量及 parser 超时，详见 "
"[Datalink](../explanation/datalink.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Each due link reads its PHY only once per step, also bounded by the compiled "
"`XGL_DATALINK_RX_CHUNK_SIZE`. `AUTO` selects 32 bytes for Boot and 128 for other profiles. The runtime "
"budget is an upper bound, not a request to drain that many bytes. When choosing a smaller chunk, recheck"
" polls per complete frame, driver buffering and parser timeout; see "
"[Datalink](../explanation/datalink.md)."

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:24
msgid ""
"在 `<xgl/xgl_runtime.h>` 中，`xgl_deadline_query(handle, now_ms, budget, &delay_ms)` 在存在截止事件时返回 "
"true。延迟为零表示立即有工作；false 保留输出原值，调用方须分开处理。"
msgstr ""
"`xgl_deadline_query(handle, now_ms, budget, &delay_ms)` in `<xgl/xgl_runtime.h>` returns true when a "
"deadline exists. A delay of zero means work is due now. False leaves the output unchanged, so the caller"
" must handle that case separately."

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:26
msgid ""
"预算指针为 `NULL` 时，查询包含全部 PHY 轮询，并使用最近一次有效 step 的 parser 超时策略。传入预算时，使用该预算的 `receive_timeout_ms`；`rx_bytes` "
"为零排除 PHY 轮询，仍计算 transport 和适用的半帧 deadline。查询不推进工作、不改变策略或重启计时。预算超时须小于 `2^31` 毫秒。无效输入返回 false 并保留输出。禁用 RX "
"后如果没有协议截止事件，应用事件需再次唤醒 owner。"
msgstr ""
"With a `NULL` budget, the query includes all PHY polls and uses the parser timeout policy from the last "
"valid step. With an explicit budget, it uses that budget's `receive_timeout_ms`. A zero `rx_bytes` "
"excludes PHY polling while retaining transport and applicable incomplete-frame deadlines. The query "
"advances no work, keeps the current policy and leaves timers running from their original start times. "
"The timeout must be below `2^31` milliseconds. Invalid input returns false and preserves the output. If "
"RX is disabled and no protocol deadline exists, an application event must wake the owner again."

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:28
msgid "主循环集成"
msgstr "Main-Loop Integration"

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:30
msgid "应用循环示意："
msgstr "Conceptual application loop:"

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:45
msgid "其中 board/application 函数是集成占位符，不是 SDK API。事件注册与等待须避免竞态，不能在轮询和睡眠之间丢失 RX 通知。唤醒后重新读取时间。"
msgstr ""
"The board/application functions are integration placeholders, not SDK functions. Make event registration"
" and waiting race-safe so an RX notification cannot be lost between polling and sleep. After waking, "
"read time again."

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:47
msgid "路由轮询截止时间也包含在 timeout 结果中。如果配置的链路轮询间隔尚未到，RX 事件仍可能要等后续调度才被读取。"
msgstr ""
"Route polling deadlines remain part of the timeout result. An RX event may require a later scheduled "
"poll if the configured link polling interval has not elapsed."

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:49
msgid "RTOS 集成"
msgstr "RTOS Integration"

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:51
msgid "在 owner task 中运行同样的循环，等待事件或相对超时。ISR 只收集字节并通知任务。同一实例不能存在重叠的协议调用。"
msgstr ""
"Run the same loop in the owner task and wait on an event or the relative timeout. ISR work only captures"
" bytes and signals the task. No protocol call may overlap with another call on the same instance."

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:53
msgid "回调执行时间应有上限。RX 字节预算不能限制用户回调耗时，也不能限制全部 transport 维护工作，应测量完整 step 的最坏执行时间。"
msgstr ""
"Keep callback execution bounded. The RX byte budget does not bound user callback duration or all "
"transport maintenance work, so measure the complete step worst case."

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:55
msgid "时间和恢复"
msgstr "Time and Recovery"

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:57
msgid "统一使用单调的 32 位毫秒时钟，经过时间小于 `2^31` 毫秒。支持时钟回绕，不支持在实例仍运行时重置时钟作为恢复手段。"
msgstr ""
"Use one monotonic 32-bit millisecond clock, with elapsed intervals below `2^31` milliseconds. Clock wrap"
" is supported; resetting the clock while the instance remains active is not a supported recovery "
"mechanism."

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:59
msgid "存在在途包、待推进消息或应用 BUSY 待交付数据时，继续调度。正确处理背压和 scope 最终失败；发送失败后无限睡眠不会释放保留资源。"
msgstr ""
"Continue scheduling while packets are awaiting feedback, retries, or application acceptance. Respect "
"backpressure and terminal scope failure; sleeping indefinitely after a failed send does not release "
"retained resources."

#: docs/zh/guides/low-power.md:61
msgid "应用 BUSY 的接收数据不会创建持续就绪的定时事件。应用恢复接纳能力后，应通知 owner task 并驱动一次 step。"
msgstr ""
"Incoming data waiting on application capacity does not generate a continuously ready timer event. When "
"capacity returns, notify the owner task and run one step."
